WEBVTT

00:05.100 --> 00:06.790
It’s a present for you, Nanami.

00:06.790 --> 00:08.290
It was just your birthday, right?

00:08.290 --> 00:10.430
You remembered!

00:10.430 --> 00:12.940
I know that you like dolls.

00:12.940 --> 00:14.560
Sorry, it’s just a cheap one.

00:14.560 --> 00:16.630
Work is tough to find during these hard times.

00:16.630 --> 00:17.720
It’s nice.

00:17.720 --> 00:19.990
Thanks, Sabu-chan!

00:22.710 --> 00:24.500
Kya, kya, kya, kya!

00:24.940 --> 00:29.100
It’s uncommon for a part-timer like you
to hang around at the club he works at.

00:29.100 --> 00:32.360
Well, I came into a bit of extra money.

00:32.360 --> 00:34.860
Aren’t you hot still dressed like this?

00:34.860 --> 00:36.890
If you want to wear a costume,
choose something cuter!

00:36.890 --> 00:37.890
Hmph!

00:37.600 --> 00:39.470
It’s cute enough I guess.

00:39.470 --> 00:41.720
But you know, I’m a good monster.

00:43.450 --> 00:47.340
And if I were a bad monster,
I would lie hidden in dark places.

00:47.340 --> 00:48.270
Just like this!

00:48.560 --> 00:51.320
Stop that!
Knock it off! You horny beast!

00:51.910 --> 00:55.860
But there are no dark places left these days.

00:55.860 --> 00:59.650
That’s why the monsters of today
lurk in the darkness of our hearts.

01:10.200 --> 01:13.320
That man is insistent on touching me...

01:13.320 --> 01:16.880
So please, Manager,
if you could give him a little warning.

01:17.220 --> 01:18.260
What the hell are you saying?!

01:18.890 --> 01:19.750
Huh?!

01:19.750 --> 01:22.300
Putting up with that sort of stuff is part of the job!

01:22.300 --> 01:24.200
Now get going and do your job!

01:31.920 --> 01:35.780
Hey, Nanami.
Stop putting that doll next to you.

01:35.780 --> 01:37.980
It’s totally weird.

01:37.980 --> 01:40.610
She said it was a present from her boyfriend.

01:40.610 --> 01:43.940
Oh yeah, you guys are living together, right?

01:43.940 --> 01:45.420
Yeah, well...

01:45.420 --> 01:47.990
Having the doll by her side
reminds her of her boyfriend...

01:47.990 --> 01:50.920
and helps her keep on working, don’t you?

01:52.590 --> 01:58.210
You’re crazy, a guy who’s okay with
letting his girlfriend do this kind of work...

01:58.210 --> 01:59.300
can’t be a decent person.

01:59.300 --> 02:00.890
That’s not true.

02:00.890 --> 02:02.550
Sabu-chan is a really kind person, and–

02:02.550 --> 02:04.030
Don’t be so stupid!

02:04.030 --> 02:07.430
It’s a pimp’s job to be sweet even if he’s not.

02:07.430 --> 02:08.100
That’s not so!

02:08.100 --> 02:10.200
Miiko, knock it off.

02:14.700 --> 02:15.600
Huh?

02:16.490 --> 02:17.780
You’re going home already?

02:17.780 --> 02:21.060
Tomorrow’s a day off, so we’re
all going out drinking till morning.

02:21.060 --> 02:22.200
I’m going home for today.

02:23.980 --> 02:26.450
My bosses have no interest in money...

02:26.450 --> 02:28.560
so I can use these commission fees as I please.

02:28.560 --> 02:30.210
Not a bad perk, eh?

02:33.530 --> 02:36.460
Oh, Miss Nanami, good night.

02:36.460 --> 02:38.100
Good night.

02:39.410 --> 02:40.970
You’re not going out drinking?

02:54.820 --> 02:57.610
That doll. I’m sure it just...

02:57.610 --> 03:00.690
DEMON PRINCE ENMA

03:11.620 --> 03:13.630
PRODUCED BY: KAZUMI KAWASHIRO

03:18.000 --> 03:20.010
PLANNED BY: DYNAMIC PLANNING

03:28.150 --> 03:32.060
Ahh, I keep saying not to
play video games all night, but...

03:33.190 --> 03:35.190
ORIGINAL STORY BY: GO NAGAI

03:44.870 --> 03:46.870
SCREENPLAY BY: TAKAWO YOSHIOKA

03:46.870 --> 03:49.780
You said she wouldn’t be home till morning.

03:50.940 --> 03:54.950
Damn, you gotta tell me
if you’re gonna be coming home early.

03:56.040 --> 04:03.750
But Sabu-chan, even after
I’ve worked hard for you till now...

04:04.390 --> 04:07.250
Well, what’s done is done anyway.

04:12.560 --> 04:14.560
Get out! Get out of here!

04:12.560 --> 04:14.560
CHARACTER DESIGN BY:
TOSHIYUKI KOMARU

04:12.560 --> 04:14.560
MONSTER DESIGN & ANIMATION DIRECTED BY: RYO TANAKA

04:39.420 --> 04:41.420
ART SETTING: TOMOYUKI AOKI

04:39.420 --> 04:41.420
ART DIRECTOR: KAZUHIRO ARAI

04:39.420 --> 04:41.420
COLOR SETTING: SACHIKO HARADA

04:42.190 --> 04:43.130
You!

04:44.900 --> 04:47.890
Die! Sabu-chan and that bitch!

04:47.890 --> 04:49.390
Everybody, I hope you all die!

04:50.180 --> 04:52.180
DIRECTOR OF
PHOTOGRAPHY:
KEISUKE TAKAHASHI
(STUDIO A-CAT)

04:50.180 --> 04:52.180
FILM EDITING:
MEGUMI UCHIDA

04:52.180 --> 04:55.120
She looked really freaked out, huh?

04:55.120 --> 04:57.700
She’s the type to nag a lot.

04:57.700 --> 04:59.650
Anyway, it’s time I ended it.

05:00.500 --> 05:01.190
Huh?

05:01.190 --> 05:03.240
MUSIC BY: KAYO KONISHI
.........................YUKIO KONDO

05:01.190 --> 05:03.240
MUSIC PRODUCER: SHUNJI INOUE

05:04.840 --> 05:06.200
A doll?

05:07.070 --> 05:09.770
Who would do that,
leave that thing in the middle of the road?

05:10.830 --> 05:11.890
This doll...

05:11.890 --> 05:12.960
What?

05:14.660 --> 05:16.000
Nothing.

05:22.050 --> 05:25.010
SOUND DIRECTOR: KATSUNORI SHIMIZU

05:22.050 --> 05:25.010
SOUND EFFECTS: MUTSUHIRO NISHIMURA
(FIZZ SOUND CREATION)

05:25.650 --> 05:27.010
Alright, let’s get outta here!

05:27.010 --> 05:30.010
LINE PRODUCERS: KICHO MINAMI (BEE MEDIA)
............................................TATSUYOSHI KOBAYASHI

05:27.010 --> 05:30.010
ASSISTANT PRODUCER: ICHINAO NAGAI

05:39.530 --> 05:40.610
What?

05:40.610 --> 05:43.610
PRODUCERS:

05:40.610 --> 05:43.610
SATSUKI MIZUNO

05:40.610 --> 05:43.610
YOSHIHIKO FUJISAWA

05:40.610 --> 05:43.610
YASHIMA TOKUHARA

05:44.440 --> 05:46.480
It was on its side just now, wasn’t it?!

05:49.480 --> 05:51.410
Stop! There’s something scary about it!

05:51.410 --> 05:52.830
It’s just a doll!

05:57.460 --> 06:00.420
DIRECTED BY: MAMORU KANBE

06:24.840 --> 06:25.520
Again!

06:25.520 --> 06:28.600
Ah, no. Yuki-chan,
I just have something to tell you...

06:31.400 --> 06:35.200
You never change, do you?

06:36.650 --> 06:41.270
If you want to see,
just ask and I’ll show you anytime.

06:43.050 --> 06:46.220
That perverse attitude
is absolutely unacceptable!

06:51.820 --> 06:54.140
Did he cause some trouble again?

06:54.140 --> 06:55.680
Who knows!

06:56.370 --> 06:57.480
A doll?

06:57.480 --> 07:00.820
Yeah, it seemed to be
looking at me and smiling...

07:00.820 --> 07:02.050
It just seemed that way, right?

07:02.050 --> 07:02.860
Huh?

07:04.330 --> 07:07.230
You’re saying it’s an evil spirit
just because of that? What do you think?

07:09.000 --> 07:12.110
Kapaeru seems a little quick to judge, right?

07:12.110 --> 07:12.740
Huh?!

07:14.240 --> 07:19.410
Fine! If you’re gonna be like that,
I’ll go off by myself and find clues!

07:19.410 --> 07:21.480
I didn’t say nobody’s gonna go with you.

07:21.480 --> 07:23.130
Huh?!

07:29.310 --> 07:30.720
What’s the cause of death?

07:30.720 --> 07:33.510
Asphyxiation by strangulation.

07:33.510 --> 07:34.940
But...

07:38.940 --> 07:40.750
What is this?

07:40.750 --> 07:43.310
Those marks seem too small
to be from human hands.

07:46.270 --> 07:47.580
Also...

07:50.190 --> 07:52.990
this blood type appears to be
different from that of the victim.

07:56.490 --> 08:01.040
And all that was left at the scene
were these small footprints.

08:01.490 --> 08:03.980
First the handprints, now these footprints.

08:03.980 --> 08:05.590
Well, I’m totally clueless.

08:06.520 --> 08:08.550
This has a familiar stink.

08:08.550 --> 08:09.640
Huh?

08:35.760 --> 08:38.310
I thought I threw it outside...

08:41.360 --> 08:42.580
Sorry...

08:43.390 --> 08:45.610
It wasn’t your fault.

08:51.750 --> 08:53.650
This... is Sabu-chan’s...

09:01.530 --> 09:03.900
This time I really threw it out.

09:18.330 --> 09:20.410
TO
COMPLETELY
SOLVE ANY
SUPERNATURAL
OR
MYSTERIOUS
INCIDENTS,
ENMA'S
DETECTIVE
AGENCY

09:38.970 --> 09:40.180
A black cloak!

09:53.870 --> 09:56.010
From today, you’ll be staying home.

10:18.950 --> 10:20.140
So, it’s here.

10:20.140 --> 10:24.150
Um, anyway, this is my place of work...

10:24.150 --> 10:26.520
so please don’t go overboard in here.

10:26.530 --> 10:27.930
It looks like a fun place.

10:27.930 --> 10:28.890
Huh?!

10:30.230 --> 10:33.030
You’re a babe, I really mean it.

10:33.030 --> 10:34.660
I’ll make you a drink.

10:34.660 --> 10:37.700
C’mon, I’ll get you an even better doll.

10:40.540 --> 10:41.830
Why is it...?

10:41.830 --> 10:42.390
What is it?

10:42.390 --> 10:43.590
No-Nothing.

10:46.860 --> 10:51.830
Umm... this is my boss, or I mean...

10:52.380 --> 10:53.580
Oh, he’s adorable!

10:53.580 --> 10:55.270
I’m Kapaeru’s, no...

10:55.270 --> 10:57.770
I’m Uncle Kawae’s nephew, Enma.

11:00.100 --> 11:02.040
Thank you for always being kind to my uncle.

11:02.040 --> 11:04.360
You’re a good boy, different from Mr. Kawae.

11:04.360 --> 11:06.600
Hey, come on over here!

11:10.680 --> 11:12.570
You smell nice!

11:12.570 --> 11:14.340
You’re a cutie.

11:14.340 --> 11:16.400
Hey, Lil’ Enma. Come over here too.

11:16.400 --> 11:17.840
Yes ma’am.

11:17.840 --> 11:22.070
Oh Boss, you’re such a...

11:22.530 --> 11:25.410
Hey Mr. Kawae, what are you dreaming about?!

11:25.410 --> 11:27.680
Go get Lil’ Enma some juice or something.

11:27.680 --> 11:29.300
Oops, my hand slipped...

11:29.300 --> 11:31.310
Now you’re going too far.

11:31.310 --> 11:34.750
So soft, it feels so good!

11:34.750 --> 11:37.140
Hey, I said stop... with that sort of thing.

11:37.140 --> 11:39.300
Heh, I’m sorry.

11:42.830 --> 11:45.330
He’s worse than a monster...

11:45.880 --> 11:48.370
Hey Kawae, is it you?

11:48.370 --> 11:50.220
Letting a boy into the club?

11:50.220 --> 11:52.450
Well you see...

11:52.450 --> 11:53.900
This is so fun!

11:53.900 --> 11:56.900
Oh Lil’ Enma, you’re such a little pervert.

11:57.290 --> 12:00.400
Do you want to put us out of business?

12:03.620 --> 12:05.830
Hey! What do you think
you’re doing? Let me go!

12:05.830 --> 12:07.510
Yeah, yeah.

12:07.510 --> 12:09.090
Oh, c’mon. That’s no fun!

12:09.090 --> 12:11.160
Come again, Lil’ Enma.

12:11.860 --> 12:13.340
This will do, yes?

12:13.340 --> 12:16.140
We’re supposed to be here working.
Do you understand?

12:16.140 --> 12:20.070
Yeah, I get it. C’mon, let’s go back in.

12:22.780 --> 12:25.180
I’m not so sure he gets it.

12:25.180 --> 12:27.750
Wow, so handsome!

12:27.750 --> 12:29.960
You’re Lil’ Enma’s older brother?

12:29.960 --> 12:32.620
It’s about time I step in
for my younger brother.

12:35.290 --> 12:36.250
Hey Boss.

12:37.430 --> 12:38.690
It’s the doll.

12:46.550 --> 12:49.640
Oh c’mon! It’s just a doll.

12:50.650 --> 12:52.360
Anyway, more important than that, liquor.

12:52.360 --> 12:54.710
Bring me a drink!

12:57.560 --> 13:00.460
Damn it! If he’s like that, I’ll do the same!

13:03.220 --> 13:05.710
Whew! Huh?!

13:05.710 --> 13:08.100
Hey, you brothers dress just the same.

13:08.100 --> 13:09.470
Looks good, doesn’t it?

13:09.470 --> 13:11.190
Are you into Goth?

13:11.190 --> 13:14.080
But that hat, isn’t it in bad taste?

13:14.080 --> 13:16.840
Yeah, like an old witch’s hat.

13:17.570 --> 13:18.740
You think so?

13:23.050 --> 13:24.800
Well, how about this?

13:29.400 --> 13:30.560
Is that alright?

13:31.370 --> 13:32.490
Just fine, just fine.

13:41.360 --> 13:42.810
Ooh!

13:42.810 --> 13:44.910
What’s wrong, Mr. Kawae?

13:47.750 --> 13:49.070
Wait, you can’t.

13:49.070 --> 13:50.950
C’mon girl!

13:52.110 --> 13:53.850
What the hell is wrong?

13:53.850 --> 13:55.390
Please stop!

14:04.200 --> 14:05.810
I’m gonna quit!

14:05.810 --> 14:07.850
Having such an awful time!

14:11.310 --> 14:12.120
In other news.

14:15.460 --> 14:20.630
As for the incident of a female body found
strangled on a Shinjuku street early today...

14:21.190 --> 14:23.880
the identity of the female
victim was confirmed.

14:24.720 --> 14:27.350
According to investigation results...

14:27.350 --> 14:32.260
the victim was Teruko Taran, a 23-year-old
restaurant worker living in Minato Ward.

14:32.260 --> 14:33.680
This person is...

14:37.570 --> 14:43.140
A large number of blood stains
from another person were at the scene...

14:43.140 --> 14:47.320
so police are investigating the vicinity
including searching for any eyewitnesses.

14:48.470 --> 14:51.090
Sabu-chan, oh no.

14:51.090 --> 14:53.370
Coming up next, the Rise & Shine
Weather Report...

14:53.370 --> 14:57.610
a detailed report of the Meteorological
Agency’s forecast for 4:00 AM.

14:59.960 --> 15:02.880
You... killed her?

15:03.520 --> 15:06.130
That... That’s not true.

15:06.130 --> 15:07.840
Definitely not true!

15:07.840 --> 15:12.180
Throughout the Japanese archipelago,
severe cold will push low temperatures...

15:12.180 --> 15:15.560
close to freezing.
It’s going to be a bitterly cold day.

15:15.560 --> 15:19.270
From Northern Kyushu to the Tohoku region
along the Japan Sea coast...

15:23.180 --> 15:26.980
And next, weather information
for the Kanto and Koshinetsu Regions.

15:28.970 --> 15:32.650
I can’t get enough of her face,
always about to cry.

15:31.490 --> 15:36.160
CUTIE HIGH

15:31.490 --> 15:36.160
NANAMI HATA

15:32.650 --> 15:35.210
I wonder what I should put her through next.

15:38.970 --> 15:40.040
Huh?!

15:40.040 --> 15:41.030
What’s that?

16:34.540 --> 16:36.300
That doll?

16:36.670 --> 16:38.850
That’s the doll Nanami had...

16:40.810 --> 16:43.100
Yikes! What the hell is this?

16:50.610 --> 16:54.110
CUTIE HIGH

16:50.610 --> 16:54.110
NANAMI HATA

16:54.110 --> 16:56.010
You only went to fool around?

16:56.010 --> 16:58.980
No, we were really working on
the investigation. Right?

16:58.980 --> 17:00.290
Yeah.

17:00.290 --> 17:03.430
Boss found nothing irregular at the bar,
so we took advantage of...

17:03.430 --> 17:05.370
Ah, you bastard!

17:05.370 --> 17:07.730
But it’s true!

17:07.730 --> 17:09.540
What do you say, Chapeauji?

17:11.460 --> 17:17.020
Yukihime, no need for restraint.

17:17.020 --> 17:18.830
Go ahead and give it to him.

17:18.830 --> 17:20.370
You Geezer!

17:21.880 --> 17:24.270
Wait! If you let me speak, you’d understand.

17:24.820 --> 17:27.500
If only you’d let me speak! Yuki-cha–

17:31.130 --> 17:33.930
So, about that incident the other day...

17:33.930 --> 17:37.530
it looks like that university
professor won’t be indicted.

17:46.010 --> 17:50.210
Lola... you’re on the swings again?

17:51.050 --> 17:54.120
You really like those swings, don’t you.

17:56.000 --> 17:59.040
Oh God! Forgive me!

17:59.040 --> 18:02.340
Forgive me Lola!

18:02.340 --> 18:04.550
Lola...

18:06.190 --> 18:09.230
Well, our work is done.
Now it’s all up to the prosecutor.

18:13.130 --> 18:14.920
I don’t like it.

18:14.920 --> 18:16.030
What?

18:33.690 --> 18:34.730
Excuse me...

18:35.540 --> 18:37.800
you’re Mr. Abashiri from the First Division, right?

18:43.230 --> 18:46.510
It’s unthinkable that such a normal person
could commit such a crime.

18:47.640 --> 18:50.170
In other words, there’s something
unusual about this murder...

18:51.040 --> 18:54.430
And neither remembers
anything from the time of the crime.

18:53.190 --> 18:56.650
FREELANCE WRITER

18:53.190 --> 18:56.650
YURI

18:54.430 --> 18:58.600
Well, at least that’s their testimony...

19:02.730 --> 19:07.820
Even idiots and brats can understand
things like that if you watch the news.

19:08.330 --> 19:09.660
One more thing.

19:11.050 --> 19:12.870
This is a just a hunch I have.

19:13.860 --> 19:19.170
There’s something in those two incidents
that no one has noticed yet.

19:22.080 --> 19:24.930
So, you think so too, Detective?

19:24.930 --> 19:27.890
That’s why you agreed to speak with me.

19:27.890 --> 19:29.180
Tell me more.

19:30.920 --> 19:33.090
I did a little research on vampires...

19:33.090 --> 19:35.390
Vampires have nothing to do with it.

19:36.370 --> 19:39.530
It’s simply a string of serial murders
by a mad university professor.

19:39.530 --> 19:41.530
Okay, then what about
the man in the black cloak?

19:41.870 --> 19:42.750
What?

19:43.530 --> 19:46.380
Midori Akaki’s testimony should verify that...

19:46.380 --> 19:48.990
she was pursued by a man in a black cloak.

19:50.440 --> 19:54.960
And as for the rumors of a vampire too,
there’s the man in the black cloak.

20:01.100 --> 20:02.880
Perhaps you can tell me?

20:07.800 --> 20:08.350
Huh?

20:09.360 --> 20:12.230
Oh, that’s just a flier I happened to find.

20:12.230 --> 20:15.230
TO
COMPLETELY
SOLVE ANY
SUPERNATURAL
OR
MYSTERIOUS
INCIDENTS,
ENMA'S
DETECTIVE
AGENCY

20:13.080 --> 20:15.230
I just thought it might make an interesting story.

20:22.330 --> 20:23.610
I’ll hold on to this.

20:26.900 --> 20:29.610
Wait a second! We haven’t finished talking.

20:32.950 --> 20:34.820
I came up dry on that one.

20:37.960 --> 20:42.510
COCOA

20:37.960 --> 20:42.510
CAPPUCCINO

20:37.960 --> 20:42.510
CHECK

20:37.960 --> 20:42.510
COFFEE SHOP ROSARIO

20:39.200 --> 20:41.300
Sure enough, I get left with the bill.

20:42.510 --> 20:44.000
Murder?

20:44.000 --> 20:46.480
No, we can’t make that determination...

20:46.480 --> 20:47.930
Don’t mince words!

20:47.930 --> 20:49.970
This situation is similar to
yesterday’s incident.

20:55.230 --> 20:58.450
The blood-stained fingerprints
match those of Yagoro Marugoshi...

20:58.450 --> 21:00.850
who lived alone in this house.

21:00.850 --> 21:03.170
I heard he owns a supermarket.

21:04.170 --> 21:05.740
They certainly seem similar.

21:05.740 --> 21:08.410
No, even more than that...

21:25.570 --> 21:27.010
The same criminal, I guess.

21:35.420 --> 21:36.390
What is it?!

21:40.830 --> 21:43.820
What kind of joke is this?

21:48.110 --> 21:50.730
Did you hear? It’s about Mr. Marugoshi.

21:51.450 --> 21:53.700
Mr. Marugoshi? The regular customer?

21:54.260 --> 21:56.990
They say he’s been killed.

21:56.990 --> 21:58.660
What do you mean “they say”?

21:58.660 --> 22:01.020
His apartment was covered in blood...

22:01.020 --> 22:03.800
and they say they have only found
one piece of the corpse.

22:03.800 --> 22:06.090
No way, that’s horrible.

22:06.090 --> 22:08.570
He wasn’t really a good customer,

22:08.570 --> 22:10.020
but still, that’s terrible.

22:10.020 --> 22:13.410
Mr. Marugoshi, he always chose you, right?

22:14.130 --> 22:15.490
Nanami?

22:15.490 --> 22:16.660
What’s wrong?

22:18.080 --> 22:20.190
I’m not feeling very well.

22:20.190 --> 22:22.460
Oh, come on!

22:22.460 --> 22:25.070
Even with you, we’re short of staff.

22:25.890 --> 22:28.710
But if I rest a little, I’ll be okay.

22:28.710 --> 22:30.570
Unbelievable! You’re no use at all!

22:33.990 --> 22:35.700
Are you leaving already?

22:35.700 --> 22:38.210
I’ll make the rounds and be right back!

22:49.970 --> 22:52.020
Yuuka, what took you so long?!

22:52.020 --> 22:54.490
If you keep behaving like a spoiled child,
I’m gonna give you an enema!

22:54.490 --> 22:55.970
Ah, that might not be so bad.

22:56.470 --> 22:58.060
How are you feeling?

22:58.060 --> 23:00.530
It’s been so lonely without you, Mina-chan.

23:00.530 --> 23:01.690
Well, you’re obviously healthy.

23:12.740 --> 23:14.100
But I...

23:14.100 --> 23:15.320
I burned you.

23:15.320 --> 23:16.580
I burned you!

23:16.580 --> 23:19.080
We have more customers than usual today.

23:19.650 --> 23:21.540
I’ll go get Nanami.

23:27.300 --> 23:28.940
For me?

23:29.500 --> 23:31.530
I didn’t ask you to kill for me...

23:37.020 --> 23:40.360
Yes, well at that time maybe I thought so.

23:41.580 --> 23:43.690
Yes, I did think so...

23:43.690 --> 23:46.670
but, not for real!

23:50.300 --> 23:52.780
Nanami, are you alright?

23:52.780 --> 23:55.620
Everyone’s working like mad.

23:58.480 --> 24:00.490
You slack off to play with a doll?

24:00.490 --> 24:02.400
What are you thinking?!

24:02.400 --> 24:02.920
No!

24:11.380 --> 24:12.370
Don’t!

24:14.460 --> 24:15.780
Don’t!

24:16.750 --> 24:18.970
Stop it! Leave her alone!

24:19.380 --> 24:20.470
She will...

24:21.380 --> 24:22.490
you’ll be...

24:26.760 --> 24:29.880
No. Nothing matters anymore...

24:33.530 --> 24:36.530
My friend? Yes, that’s right.

24:37.040 --> 24:38.310
You’re...

24:40.000 --> 24:43.500
the friend that will protect me, my special friend.

24:44.590 --> 24:46.730
Wh-What is this?!

24:50.260 --> 24:52.180
What’s with that girl!

24:52.180 --> 24:53.610
She gives me the creeps.

25:30.920 --> 25:33.260
Hey, isn’t Miiko taking too long?

25:33.260 --> 25:36.260
I thought Nanami just came in,
and now it’s Miiko?

25:44.140 --> 25:45.500
What the hell is that?

25:45.500 --> 25:46.930
Aren’t you motivated to do your job?!

25:49.570 --> 25:50.060
Hey!

25:50.940 --> 25:52.570
Answer me at least!

25:58.490 --> 26:01.230
Hey! There, there...

26:26.030 --> 26:29.250
Miiko, there you are!

26:30.040 --> 26:31.440
Isn’t that Nanami’s?

26:32.880 --> 26:35.150
Nanami gave it to me.

26:35.950 --> 26:39.160
I’ll... give it to you too, Miss Moe.

26:48.500 --> 26:51.420
You guys are acting a little... strange.

27:18.450 --> 27:18.950
Huh?

27:23.500 --> 27:25.030
I understand.

27:25.030 --> 27:27.550
You mean the man in black
that came yesterday, right?

27:28.170 --> 27:30.790
I will ask Miss Moe to take care of him.

27:41.840 --> 27:44.550
CUTIE HIGH

27:41.840 --> 27:44.550
NANAMI HATA

27:46.060 --> 27:49.310
SAILOR
SCHOOL
UNIFORMS

27:46.060 --> 27:49.310
GYM CLOTHES

27:46.060 --> 27:49.310
MAID

27:46.060 --> 27:49.310
NURSE

27:46.060 --> 27:49.310
WORRY-FREE

27:46.060 --> 27:49.310
LOW PRICES

27:46.060 --> 27:49.310
EVERYTHING PRE-PAID

27:46.060 --> 27:49.310
NEWLY OPEN!

27:46.060 --> 27:49.310
CUTIE HIGH

27:52.310 --> 27:55.180
It’s the police. Is there anyone here?

28:32.170 --> 28:33.500
It’s the police!

28:34.880 --> 28:36.790
Is there anyone here?!

29:00.130 --> 29:02.170
OUT OF RANGE

29:06.000 --> 29:08.140
Y-You girls work here?

29:08.900 --> 29:11.560
Police. What’s a corpse doing here?

29:18.110 --> 29:19.220
D-Don’t move!

29:25.700 --> 29:29.620
The number you dialed is not available.

29:29.620 --> 29:32.300
The phone is currently out of range
or the power has been shut off.

29:29.620 --> 29:36.620
REDIAL

29:29.620 --> 29:36.620
OYAMADA

29:32.950 --> 29:36.140
I’ll be fine just asking some questions
at the cabaret club by myself.

29:47.760 --> 29:50.160
Oh, it’s rare you take
things like that, Mr. Abashiri...

29:50.160 --> 29:53.170
in spite of disliking them so much.

29:53.170 --> 29:56.570
Dangerous incidents
have been on the rise.

29:57.430 --> 29:58.770
It’s just sort of a protective charm.

29:59.870 --> 30:03.570
I’ll be taking the day off today.

30:04.880 --> 30:05.800
Hmm?

30:06.560 --> 30:07.890
That’s strange.

30:07.890 --> 30:08.860
What is it?

30:08.860 --> 30:11.550
Someone should be at the club by now.

30:11.550 --> 30:13.920
Kapa-chan, you’ve got mail.

30:13.920 --> 30:16.360
Oh! Information from Sat-chan.

30:16.360 --> 30:18.590
Is it that hell friend thing of yours?

30:18.590 --> 30:21.170
Not “hell friend”, mail-friend.

30:21.170 --> 30:23.450
Whatever, either way it’s all the same.

30:24.510 --> 30:27.890
Um, “Kapa-chan, how’s it going?”

30:27.890 --> 30:30.450
“Here is today’s update from Sat-chan.”

30:30.450 --> 30:35.070
“This time the truth is still a bit unclear,
but I’ll tell you the gist anyway.”

30:35.070 --> 30:38.040
A murderous doll?!

30:38.040 --> 30:41.000
“A discarded doll starts
moving around at night...”

30:41.000 --> 30:44.210
“walking around looking for its owner?”

30:44.210 --> 30:49.000
“They say those that have seen it
walking around get killed by it.”

30:49.000 --> 30:51.730
“The other day, a person was violently
killed in the street...”

30:51.730 --> 30:56.000
“and there were little doll footprints
scattered here and there.”

30:56.000 --> 30:56.980
Boss!

30:56.980 --> 30:59.900
A damn doll. I’ve heard enough.

30:59.900 --> 31:00.760
Huh?

31:02.400 --> 31:03.590
Oh, is this Miss Moe?

31:03.590 --> 31:04.970
Moe?

31:08.880 --> 31:10.950
To that club again?

31:10.950 --> 31:14.540
It looks like the girl
has lured them back to the club.

31:14.540 --> 31:17.140
Foolishly, off they went.

31:21.010 --> 31:23.560
Look! They’re open for business.

31:23.560 --> 31:25.370
That’s strange.

31:25.370 --> 31:28.070
Why can’t I get through by phone?

31:28.070 --> 31:32.780
She’s cute asking me to
take time to come to the club.

31:32.780 --> 31:34.450
He doesn’t have any suspects...

31:34.450 --> 31:37.080
He’s the type of guy
who gets deceived by women.

31:38.020 --> 31:39.080
Welcome.

31:39.870 --> 31:41.790
Well, here I am!

31:47.760 --> 31:51.380
Kappa, let’s have some more fun today.

31:53.830 --> 31:55.010
Stay on your guard!

31:55.010 --> 31:56.200
Huh?

31:56.200 --> 31:58.590
My eyebrows are twitching in a strange way.

31:58.590 --> 31:59.380
Boss, that means...

31:59.380 --> 32:00.810
What’s wrong?

32:01.370 --> 32:02.850
M-Miss Nanami...

32:03.520 --> 32:05.930
You’re looking adorable today too.

32:13.240 --> 32:13.950
Huh?

32:13.950 --> 32:15.640
Where is the doll?

32:15.640 --> 32:17.740
You always carried it with you, right?

32:18.390 --> 32:20.500
Why are you so worried about that doll?

32:20.500 --> 32:21.900
Uh, that’s um...

32:27.530 --> 32:28.850
Oh, where’s your hat?

32:28.850 --> 32:31.510
I don’t wanna be wearing
such an old-fashioned hat.

32:33.070 --> 32:36.050
That’s not a doll...

32:36.370 --> 32:37.370
Wha–?

32:37.370 --> 32:38.700
She’s...

32:39.300 --> 32:40.610
a dear friend.

32:41.410 --> 32:42.560
Huh?

32:44.370 --> 32:47.230
Ma-Ma-Manager!

32:53.630 --> 32:55.570
D-D-Doll!

32:55.570 --> 32:57.570
We’ve been fooled!

32:58.550 --> 33:00.750
So you were in that doll.

33:01.580 --> 33:04.370
It saved me the trouble of looking for it.

33:16.490 --> 33:18.730
Shit! Which is the real one?!

33:18.730 --> 33:19.680
Damn, you bastards!

33:22.340 --> 33:23.390
Chapeauji!

33:23.900 --> 33:27.050
I’m gonna catch them in the act
and teach them a lesson.

33:30.880 --> 33:31.890
Rain?

33:32.690 --> 33:34.260
Oh heck!

33:34.260 --> 33:36.090
Yukihime, hurry up!

33:36.910 --> 33:38.410
Boss!

33:38.410 --> 33:39.910
D-Damn!

33:39.910 --> 33:41.150
Everyone...

33:42.060 --> 33:44.330
Everyone should die...

33:45.120 --> 33:48.420
Everyone I hate.

33:50.280 --> 33:52.510
That’s the real one.

34:23.900 --> 34:25.080
Enma!

34:29.970 --> 34:30.960
What’s going on?

34:32.420 --> 34:33.460
Yuki-chan, is it you?

34:35.040 --> 34:37.380
M-Miss, it’s the doll behind you!

34:37.380 --> 34:38.260
Huh?

34:44.930 --> 34:46.390
You did it!

34:50.650 --> 34:52.290
Yuki-chan, you’re a lifesaver.

34:52.290 --> 34:53.650
What are you saying?!

34:53.650 --> 34:55.650
Wrong! The possessed one!

34:55.990 --> 34:56.850
Huh?

34:58.860 --> 34:59.610
Yuki-chan!

35:16.970 --> 35:19.470
Watch it! Don’t get possessed, Princess!

35:19.470 --> 35:20.260
Bastard!

35:20.260 --> 35:22.430
N-No way! Even Yukihime will!

35:36.460 --> 35:37.360
What?

36:10.770 --> 36:12.010
Decide.

36:12.010 --> 36:13.470
Will you come with me...

36:13.470 --> 36:15.140
or be destroyed right here?

36:19.560 --> 36:20.530
So be it.

36:33.040 --> 36:35.740
It wasn’t the doll,

36:35.740 --> 36:38.140
but the girl who was possessed.

36:38.140 --> 36:39.510
What a sucker I am!

36:42.430 --> 36:43.260
What?

36:44.000 --> 36:45.580
What’s happened?

36:45.580 --> 36:47.720
Everyone... die.

36:48.460 --> 36:50.380
Everyone die.

36:50.380 --> 36:51.270
Everyone...

36:53.550 --> 36:57.100
What sort of darkness has taken over this girl?

36:55.650 --> 36:58.510
Everyone... die.

36:57.100 --> 37:00.680
There is not one person who doesn’t have darkness in their heart.

37:00.680 --> 37:03.030
That’s just how it is.

37:07.610 --> 37:11.430
But how could she just cast away
the demon that tried to take over...

37:11.430 --> 37:14.430
Where could that sort of power have come from?

37:19.870 --> 37:24.760
Was the doll an illusion
created by the demon, I wonder...

37:24.760 --> 37:26.010
You!

37:26.300 --> 37:27.720
Die!

37:27.720 --> 37:29.730
Sabu-chan and that bitch!

37:29.730 --> 37:30.970
Everybody, I hope you all die!

37:49.870 --> 37:53.040
You always act like a pervert
and just got what you deserved.

37:53.040 --> 37:54.430
What do you mean, always?!

37:54.430 --> 37:56.120
What do you mean what?!

37:56.120 --> 37:57.370
What means...

38:01.230 --> 38:03.090
The doll...

38:03.090 --> 38:07.130
the doll always kills everyone for me.

38:07.560 --> 38:12.140
That woman who stole Sabu-chan
and that horrible customer.

38:12.490 --> 38:15.140
Are you listening, Sabu-chan?

38:15.410 --> 38:17.680
That doll kills everyone for me.

38:27.630 --> 38:29.820
PIGUMA: CORPSELESS DEMON

38:47.900 --> 38:55.840
In the darkness of night, laying in bed
Tonight also, ever deeper decadence

38:55.840 --> 39:05.640
Smeared with grotesque make-up
Heart and body soaked, so upside-down

39:07.250 --> 39:10.010
Upside-down

39:12.720 --> 39:20.890
Make you, make me thrilled
Under the moonlight, honey

39:20.890 --> 39:28.480
Spit upon the bound-up heart

39:28.480 --> 39:36.210
Do the trip
Come on let’s dance, mired in depravity

39:36.210 --> 39:45.360
In return for this degradation,
unhidden jealous heart

39:45.360 --> 39:49.480
Body lusting for riot

39:59.910 --> 40:01.920
Next Episode Preview

40:03.130 --> 40:08.340
On behalf of Kapaeru, Enma meets
a young girl who provides information.

40:08.340 --> 40:13.930
Meanwhile, an accident happens to
Midori Akaki, the first victim.

40:14.280 --> 40:19.940
Without a sound, calmly and quietly
everything starts to break down.

40:20.810 --> 40:24.940
Demon Prince Enma,
Episode 3, “Karuma.”

40:24.940 --> 40:27.910
Over there-something is lurking.

40:25.020 --> 40:25.060
KARUMA
